  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="transcription" xml:id="transcription_aad_0168" xml:lang="en">
          <div type="letter">
        <pb facs="https://iiif.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/aad/aad_00509/" ed="1r" type="sheet"/>
            <div type="letter_message" hand="#type_black_else">
              <opener>
                <seg hand="#print_saint_davids_university_college">
                  <lb/><hi rend="underline" hand="#print_saint_davids_university_college"><rs type="org" ref="#amp_organization_361">Prifysgol Cymru</rs></hi>
                  <lb/><rs type="org" ref="#amp_organization_360">COLEG PRIFYSGOL DEWI SANT</rs>
                  <lb/><rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_561">LLANBEDR PONT STEFFAN</rs>
                  <lb/><rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_563">Ceredigion</rs>
                </seg>
                <seg hand="#print_saint_davids_university_college">
                  <lb/><hi rend="underline" hand="#print_saint_davids_university_college"><rs type="org" ref="#amp_organization_361">University of Wales</rs></hi>
                  <lb/><rs type="org" ref="#amp_organization_360">SAINT DAVID'S UNIVERSITY COLLEGE</rs>
                  <lb/><rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_561">LAMPETER</rs>
                  <lb/><rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_563">Cardiganshire</rs>
                </seg>
                <seg hand="#print_saint_davids_university_college">
                  <lb/>Tel : Lampeter 351/352/415 - Ext.:
                </seg>
                <dateline>  
                  <date>
                    <lb/><space quantity="46" unit="char"/>5th June I973 
                  </date>
                </dateline>
                <salute>
                  <lb/><rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_1">Dear Mr. Auden</rs>,
                </salute>
              </opener>
              <p>
                <lb/><space quantity="8" unit="char"/>Thank you for your letter of May 3Ist. I am very pleased
                <lb/>that you have been able to accept our invitation to come and give
                <lb/>a poetry reading at the College. 
              </p>
              <p>
                <lb/><space quantity="8" unit="char"/>I will be happy t<subst><del rend="overtyped" hand="#type_black_else">p</del><add place="superimposed" hand="#type_black_else">o</add></subst> arrange for someone to pick you up from,
                <lb/>and return you to, Oxford. I would be grateful if you would suggest
                <lb/>a convenient date (the only evening it is not possible to give a
                <lb/>reading is Sunday) in late November/early December. If it is poss-
                <lb/>i<subst><del rend="overtyped" hand="#type_black_else">h</del><add place="superimposed" hand="#type_black_else">b</add></subst>le to give me some indication of how long you would like to stay
                <lb/>in Lampeter, I will be able to make arrangements for your <subst><del rend="overstrike" hand="#hand_black_else">ac<unclear>oc</unclear>mmat</del><add place="above" hand="#hand_black_else">accommodation.</add></subst>-
                <lb/><del rend="overstrike" hand="#hand_black_else">ion</del>.
              </p>
              <p>
                <lb/><space quantity="8" unit="char"/>With regard to your fee it will be possible to offer you
                <lb/>twenty-five pounds - I hope you will find this acceptable. I shall
                <lb/>of course arrange for the society to pay for your <subst><del rend="overstrike" hand="#hand_black_else">a<gap reason="illegible" quantity="3" unit="char"></gap>d<unclear>a</unclear>ti<gap reason="illegible" quantity="1" unit="char"></gap>n</del><add place="above" hand="#hand_black_else">accommodation</add></subst> etc
                <lb/>whilst in Lampeter.
              </p>
              <p>
                <lb/><space quantity="8" unit="char"/>Nearer the time I will make specific arrangements for collect-
                <lb/>ing you from Oxford.
              </p>
              <closer>
                <salute>
                  <lb/>Yours sincerely,
                </salute>
                <signed hand="#hand_black_else">
                  <lb/><hi rend="underline" hand="#hand_black_else"><rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_554">Richard Else</rs></hi>
                </signed>
                <signed>
                  <lb/><rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_554">Richard Else</rs>
                </signed>
              </closer>
            </div> 
        <pb facs="https://iiif.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/aad/aad_00510/" ed="1v" type="sheet"/>
            <div>
              <ab hand="#hand_blue_unident_0168">
                <lb/>23
              </ab>
            </div>
          </div>
